 {"name": "negative", "link": 5, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 6, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CFG"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样器"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "label": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "label": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "KSampler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 275], "pos": [1252.800048828125, 0], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#25 ImageUpscaleWithModel\n作用：接收输入图像与超分模型，对画面进行放大并重建细节，输出更高清的图像结果。\n参数：\n- upscale_model：当前值=来自 节点#24 UpscaleModelLoader 的 `UPSCALE_MODEL` 输出；作用：接收 latent 上采样模型，用于提升 latent 分辨率；范围：UPSCALE_MODEL 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- image：当前值=来自 节点#8 VAEDecode 的 `IMAGE` 输出；作用：接收上游图像数据；范围：图像数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#928aa6", "size": [240, 298], "pos": [2088, 188], "id": 37, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 28, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 942], "pos": [2505.60009765625, 0], "id": 20, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [6], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": [1080, 1920, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 140], "pos": [835.7832641601562, 437.87542724609375], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#21 CR Text\n作用：接收或创建一段文本并原样输出，常作为提示词模板/变量中转给后续文本处理节点。\n参数：\n- text：当前值=...；作用：输入文本内容（正/负提示词）；范围：字符串，通常 0 ~ 4096 字符；默认：空字符串。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#928aa6", "size": [240, 172], "pos": [416.3319091796875, 1045.4091796875], "id": 35, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [22], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["这是一张在狭小拥挤的日式居酒屋里用闪光灯拍摄的照片，屋里摆满了手写菜单、老海报和木质纹理。光线来自机顶闪光灯的直射，营造出明亮的高光、刺眼的阴影和略带颗粒感的纹理，增强了照片的自然感。\n画面主体是一位年轻女子坐在酒吧木凳上，微微侧身，目光越过肩膀，望向镜头。她身穿白色纽扣衬衫和高腰格纹短裙，露出双腿，为画面增添了一抹青春随意的气息。\n闪光灯柔和地照亮了她的脸庞——双颊绯红，红唇闪耀光泽，目光与镜头交汇，眼神微妙、俏皮却又充满亲密感。她的笑容温柔却又充满暗示，透着一丝警觉与温暖。她的姿态和目光在自信与柔和之间营造出一种微妙的张力。\n背景昏暗，挤满了身着深色衣服的老年顾客，与她明亮的身影形成鲜明对比。构图紧凑自然，是90年代日本一次性相机摄影的典型特征——高闪光对比度、轻微的模糊和自然的瑕疵。\n整体氛围怀旧、温暖，略带一丝暧昧——捕捉真实、亲近、充满情感的瞬间，就像闪光灯照亮的个人记忆，而不是摆拍的肖像。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 446], "pos": [418.4052734375, 528.6024169921875], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 18}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [507.39704235297404, -332.210651234542], "scale": 0.9646149645000022}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 300, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "🔽邀请码：s9xsklf4", "bounding": [-3010.052978515625, -558.6207885742188, 2973.1748046875, 421.0096130371094]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "提示词", "bounding": [397.6273193359375, 440.0257873535156, 273.73211669921875, 561.0209350585938]}], "links": [[1, 1, 0, 4, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 2, 0, 5, 0, "CLIP"], [3, 5, 0, 4, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [4, 5, 0, 6, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [5, 6, 0, 4, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [6, 7, 0, 4, 3, "LATENT"], [7, 4, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [8, 3, 0, 8, 1, "VAE"], [22, 21, 0, 5, 1, "STRING"], [26, 24, 0, 25, 0, "UPSCALE_MODEL"], [27, 8, 0, 25, 1, "IMAGE"], [28, 25, 0, 20, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "cff3c9b6-230e-4a46-a631-034aab0083f8", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 39, "revision": 0}